## Pickforge GitHub Issues as source of truth

When working in any repo under `~/Projects/Pickforge`, prefer the workspace policy in `~/Projects/Pickforge/AGENTS.md` and the `plan-issue` workflow/skill. In short: use GitHub Issues as the canonical plan/progress tracker for substantial work, keep the issue checklist phone-friendly, link PRs to issues, and create/link follow-up issues for valid deferred review/CI problems.

